---
title: "TransactionTypeContractCreationError_init (Osaka Fork: Transaction Exceptions)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: transaction received
    q_validate --> q_format: msg = "transaction type {type(transaction).__name__} not allowed to create contracts"
    q_format --> q_super: super().__init__(msg)
    q_super --> [*]: self.transaction = transaction
    note right of q_super
        INV-001: transaction object is stored as a reference, enabling inspection of the offending transaction
        INV-002: error message dynamically includes the transaction type name via __name__
    end note
